   					&amp;lt;/field&amp;gt;
   					&amp;lt;field&amp;gt;
   						&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;write_sequence_number&amp;lt;/name&amp;gt;
   						&amp;lt;description&amp;gt;Indicates the sequence number of the next descriptor for the write host to operate on. If the transfer mode is Memory-Mapped to Streaming, this field output is 0. This field is applicable only when Extended Feature Support parameter is enabled.&amp;lt;/description&amp;gt;
